---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
	title="Privacy Policy — Cute Timer | Cute Pomodoro Timer"
	description="Read the Cute Timer privacy policy. We don't collect personal data — everything you set stays in your own browser's local storage. Simple, private, and free."
	canonical="https://cutepomodorotimer.com/privacy-policy/"
>
	<p class="eyebrow text-[var(--accent-ink)]">Your privacy matters ♡</p>
	<h1 class="mt-2 text-3xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-4xl">Privacy Policy</h1>
	<p class="mt-4 text-sm leading-relaxed text-body sm:text-base">
		Last updated: <span class="font-semibold text-ink">August 9, 2026</span>. This privacy policy explains how
		Cute Timer ("we", "us") handles information when you use our website at
		<span class="font-semibold text-ink">cutepomodorotimer.com</span>.
	</p>

	<section class="mt-8">
		<h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-3xl">The short version</h2>
		<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-body sm:text-base">
			We do not collect, store, or share any personal information about you. No accounts, no tracking profiles,
			no data sold to anyone — ever. Cute Timer is a client-side app: everything happens in your browser.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-8">
		<h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-3xl">Local storage only</h2>
		<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-body sm:text-base">
			To make the timer feel personal, we store a few settings in your browser's local storage: your chosen timer
			durations, auto-break preference, sound and notification settings, your to-do list, the lo-fi track you
			liked, volume, and your theme and language preferences. This data never leaves your device and is never sent
			to our servers. You can clear it at any time by clearing your browser's site data.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-8">
		<h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-3xl">Analytics and cookies</h2>
		<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-body sm:text-base">
			Cute Timer does not use tracking cookies, advertising cookies, or third-party analytics scripts. We have no
			interest in following you around the internet.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-8">
		<h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-3xl">Third-party services</h2>
		<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-body sm:text-base">
			Our pages load the Baloo 2 font from Google Fonts and, when you play music, stream two lo-fi audio files
			from our own hosting. These services may process your IP address as part of normal internet traffic. We do
			not control their privacy practices and encourage you to review their policies.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-8">
		<h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-3xl">Notifications</h2>
		<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-body sm:text-base">
			If you enable browser notifications, your browser handles the permission and delivery locally. We never
			receive your notification data.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-8">
		<h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-3xl">Children's privacy</h2>
		<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-body sm:text-base">
			Because we collect no personal data at all, Cute Timer is safe for everyone, including children. If you
			believe your child has shared personal information with us through a contact message, please reach out and
			we'll delete it promptly.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-8">
		<h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-3xl">Changes to this policy</h2>
		<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-body sm:text-base">
			We may update this policy from time to time. When we do, we'll revise the "last updated" date above. Please
			check back here for the latest version.
		</p>
	</section>

	<section class="mt-8">
		<h2 class="mb-3 text-2xl font-extrabold leading-snug text-ink sm:text-3xl">Contact</h2>
		<p class="text-sm leading-relaxed text-body sm:text-base">
			Questions about privacy? We'd love to hear from you at
			<a
				href="mailto:hello@cutepomodorotimer.com"
				class="font-semibold text-[var(--accent-ink)] underline decoration-[color-mix(in_srgb,var(--accent)_50%,transparent)] underline-offset-2 transition-colors hover:text-ink"
				>hello@cutepomodorotimer.com</a
			>.
		</p>
	</section>
</PageLayout>
